    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Chasers is a silly action game where you chase chickens around different environments, each with unique challenges, while maneuvering the novel controls of a pogo stick. Your only objective is to <strong>collect all the coins in the levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unorthodox controls and chaotic chicken movement patterns create an enraging and engaging player experience. Chicken Chasers is designed to be a causal experience -- you can finish the levels at your own pace. There is a Steam-integrated leader board to celebrate the fastest level completion times and a multiplayer mode for extra chaos!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Chasers is a silly action game where you chase chickens around different environments, each with unique challenges, while maneuvering the novel controls of a pogo stick. Your only objective is to <strong>collect all the coins in the levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unorthodox controls and chaotic chicken movement patterns create an enraging and engaging player experience. Chicken Chasers is designed to be a causal experience -- you can finish the levels at your own pace. There is a Steam-integrated leader board to celebrate the fastest level completion times and a multiplayer mode for extra chaos!</p>",
    "short_description": "Master the unique movement mechanic of your pogo stick and chase chaotic chickens across unique environments. Casually progress through the levels or get competitive by aiming to climb the time-challenge leader board. Play alone or with others!",
